From efebe153b1af556b2ea19f1ffb4dd86cf0d9e699 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kuteka Deploy <deploy@kutekalink.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 10:11:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ecosystem): feedback workflow, matching notify,
 completeness, agent leads
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Re-implement kuteka ecosystem execution package:
- Migrations 0043–0048 (beta feedback RLS/RPC/status, availability notify, assign interest)
- Property completeness checklist; beta feedback status machine + inbox controls
- Availability notify helpers; agent claim leads UI + i18n
- Marketplace becomeProvider and Explore captureDemand CTAs
- Auth RLS matrix helpers/tests; founder pending decisions + RLS regression docs
